<title>USA: Details on U.S. sanctions on Burma expected soon.</title>
<headline>Details on U.S. sanctions on Burma expected soon.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The White House will likely issue an executive order soon giving more details of U.S. sanctions against Burma for its alleged human rights abuses, a White House official said Thursday.</p>
<p>The Clinton administration in April announced a ban on new American investment in Burma in condemnation of the military government's alleged human rights abuses and repression of the democracy movement.</p>
<p>&quot;We expect it to happen within a very short period of time,&quot; the official said of the executive order.</p>
</text>
